%% ==== status
stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> QUEUED: upload accepted
  QUEUED --> PROCESSING: worker takes the job
  PROCESSING --> COMPLETED: results written
  PROCESSING --> QUEUED: error, retry left
  PROCESSING --> FAILED: error on last attempt
  QUEUED --> CANCELLED: Cancel
  PROCESSING --> CANCELLED: Cancel, worker stops
  COMPLETED --> QUEUED: Re-analyse
  FAILED --> QUEUED: Re-analyse
  CANCELLED --> QUEUED: Re-analyse
  COMPLETED --> [*]: Delete
  FAILED --> [*]: Delete
  CANCELLED --> [*]: Delete
  QUEUED --> [*]: Delete

%% ==== pipeline
flowchart LR
  subgraph S1["Video, detection and pitch"]
    direction TB
    V[/"Uploaded video<br/>any codec, 25 or 50 fps"/] --> T["0 · H.264 playback copy · 0–5 %<br/>PyAV / libx264<br/>the analysis reads this copy"]
    T --> DT["1 · Detection + tracking · 5–60 %<br/>YOLOv8x · stride scaled to 25 fps<br/>ByteTrack IDs · up to 5 ball candidates"]
    DT --> KP["2 · Pitch keypoints · 60–88 %<br/>YOLOv8-pose, 32 landmarks<br/>RANSAC homography"]
    KP --> HS["Camera model<br/>smoothed over 1.5 s"]
    HS --> P["Project feet → pitch metres<br/>(105 × 68 m)"]
  end
  subgraph S2["Clean-up, teams and tactics"]
    direction TB
    C["Clean-up<br/>people off the pitch · real ball"] --> TA["3 · Teams · 88–93 %<br/>shirt colour vs local grass · K-Means<br/>referees by kit · goalkeepers by position"]
    TA --> ST["4 · Tactics · 93–98 %<br/>join tracks · smoothing · ball gaps"]
    ST --> F["Formations<br/>Hungarian matching · 20 s stability"]
    F --> POS["Position labels<br/>slots of the main formation"]
    ST --> M["Metrics<br/>shape · distance · speed · heatmaps"]
    POS --> R[/"5 · results JSON v3 · 98–100 %"/]
    M --> R
  end
  S1 --> S2

